<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Trushko et al. (2020) Dev. Cell & Hannezo et al. (2014) PNAS Föppl-von Kármán spherical epithelial cyst buckling under alginate confinement (Mammalian polarized epithelial cyst monolayers (Canis lupus familiaris MDCK II, Homo sapiens Caco-2))",
        "Trushko et al. (2020) Dev. Cell & Hannezo et al. (2014) PNAS Föppl-von Kármán spherical epithelial cyst buckling under alginate confinement faithfully reproduces Mammalian polarized epithelial cyst monolayers (Canis lupus familiaris MDCK II, Homo sapiens Caco-2) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2019-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mammalian polarized epithelial cyst monolayers (Canis lupus familiaris MDCK II, Homo sapiens Caco-2) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-epithelioid-cyst-buckling-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/33e07ad/2019-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling.py> ;
    schema:about "Mammalian polarized epithelial cyst monolayers (Canis lupus familiaris MDCK II, Homo sapiens Caco-2)" ;
    pk:aristotelianEfficientCause "7. Elastic Shell/Sheet Buckling" ;
