<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Trushko et al. (2020) Dev. Cell & Hannezo et al. (2014) PNAS Föppl-von Kármán spherical epithelial cyst buckling under alginate confinement — MorphoEval overall 93.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) remediated evaluation of `2019-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 93.3/100, up from 56.2/100 in Pass 1). Replaces the v1 heuristic dent contour with an L-BFGS-B Föppl-von Kármán + vertex monolayer ring energy minimizer inside a spherical alginate microcapsule, evaluates all 4 capsule regimes including the unconfined/soft control (delta/R_0 = 0) and Blebbistatin myosin-II inhibition, achieves r = 1.0000 (log-log slope 1.990) across the 12-point Zoelly (h/R_0)^2 critical pressure scaling dataset, and segments 19 epithelial cyst cross-sections from the vendored histology micrograph (`epithelioid_cyst_specimen.jpg`). Overall 93.0/100 (faithfulness 92.1, reproducibility 94.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 33e07ad; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 93, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 96, Code-to-model traceability 95, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/epithelioid_cyst_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2019-trushko-epithelioid-cyst-buckling.py at 33e07ad, image/png, 708830 B, 2015×1248 px, artifact_sha256 6a23af40a2ce6d099e3f53f0ebf86b0a2b66560af9d7a03bb69a2cb0dd7735b9 (sha256 6a23af40a2ce6d099e3f53f0ebf86b0a2b66560af9d7a03bb69a2cb0dd7735b9), spec_fingerprint 8c51faae6711c461b674cf68b978bc7ce168e67b48347c008c6f0f5cae0506b9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c51faae6711c461b674cf68b978bc7ce168e67b48347c008c6f0f5cae0506b9; artifact_sha256: 6a23af40a2ce6d099e3f53f0ebf86b0a2b66560af9d7a03bb69a2cb0dd7735b9; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/epithelioid_cyst_buckling_reference.json=c1412a6f1bcc24be..., datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/epithelioid_cyst_specimen.jpg=ec5b534f7a3a8182..., datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/paper_citations.bib=b14ab196e08a46d4..., datasets/epithelioid_cyst_buckling/scout_manifest.json=3d03ec2877bdf349...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D equatorial Föppl-von Kármán ring solver to a full 3D triangulated vertex shell with apical-basal differential tension." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

